  "title": "Wild Rice with Rosemary and Cashew Stuffing",
  "description": "Essentially, this is a rice pilaf that I have modified ever-so-slightly to be used as a stuffing for a small roasting chicken. The type of nuts, mushroom, and herbs can be varied in any number of ways.",
